CM NGF round-trip test (step 1): generate NGF file from a 5-segment wire.
CM Run this before ngf_gf_load.deck to produce test_wg_roundtrip.ngf.
CM Expected: no errors, NGF file produced, no simulation output (WG exits early).
CE
GW 1 5 0 0 0 0 0 1 0.001
GE 0
FR 0 1 0 0 300
WG !test_wg_roundtrip.ngf
EN
